          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your shots zip around corners and fly at impossible angles to reach your target.</p>\n<p>Make a bow or crossbow Strike against a foe you can see; the ammunition travels to your target, even going around corners. You ignore the target's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] condition and all cover.</p>"
